<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40796" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισείω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισσ-</span></b>  (as always in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shake at</i> or
				<i>against</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>, esp.
			with the view of scaring, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτ᾽ ἂν . .
				Ζεὺς . . αὐτὸς ἐπισσείῃσιν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρεμνὴν αἰγίδα πᾶσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.167
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.230
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισείουσα τὸν λόφον ἐκπλήττει</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">με</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				19.1
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				2.2
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δόρατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					2.13.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πόλεμον</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ πατρίδι</span>
			<i>stir up . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.17.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πέρσας ἐ</span>. <i>hold</i>
			them <i>out as a threat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν χεῖρα</span>, in
			token of assent or applause, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Pr.Im.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δ᾽ ἔσεισεν κόμαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					1276
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόσσον
			ἐπισσείει</span> so she <i>seems to threaten</i>, of a
			statue, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.755
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμαι ἐ. τοῖς κροτάφοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					12.27
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἐπισεισθέντα</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν παθῶν σκηπτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.210
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>urge
			on</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππον</span>] <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				147
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὶ τὰς δρακοντώδεις κόρας</span>
			<i>set</i> them <i>upon</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				255
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πόλιν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοί</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				613
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ᾽πίσειέ μοι τὸν Μισγόλαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					3
				</span></i>
			; <i>hurl at</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ πέτρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Parth.
					14.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. intr.,
				<i>assault</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς τείχεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.94
				</span></i>
			 codd. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>.
				<i>shake so as to touch</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Callistr.
				<u>Stat.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.147
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
